{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111070414037-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111092920\"/><p>美松苑有保安員暈倒。</p><p>大圍有人暈倒。今晨(11日)6時53分，美田路25號美松苑保安員報案，指發現一名姓陳(46歲)男同事在上址暈倒。救護員接報到場，將昏迷陳男送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，案件列「有人暈倒」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:14.054929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:04:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:19.776098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:52.813612+00:00","content_hash":"6e98cc36b6a8fdf10461de3e6b2ad4ea4323614094b45dec0d8c2737b3e8dab1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}